OL,3,GNEWSAClimate emergency declaration
OL,4,Ascrapped by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third council in West Yorkshire has
OL,7,Fscrapped its climate emergency
OL,8,Fdeclaration, seven years after it was
OL,9,Fintroduced.
OL,11,FKirklees Council, now under the control
OL,12,Fof Reform UK, voted to roll back its
OL,13,F2019 commitment to reach net zero
OL,14,Femissions by 2038 at a full meeting of
OL,15,Fthe authority on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
