OL,3,GNEWSAClimate emergency declaration
OL,4,Ascrapped by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors voted by 32 votes to 30 in
OL,7,Ffavour of the motion on an
OL,8,F"undeclaration of climate emergency"
OL,9,Fafter a lively debate in which Reform
OL,10,Fwas accused of providing a lack of
OL,11,Fdetail on their plans and perpetuating
OL,12,F"this wider culture war" over the
OL,13,Fissue.
OL,15,FIn response, Reform council leader
OL,16,FSarah Wood said critics "had either not
OL,17,Fread the detail of the motion, or
OL,18,Fhaven't truly understood it".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
